# Crypt (Crawl's first scene): candles gutter (a note each), wax runs, the bell tolls, water drips, a choir under
# them; black keys snuff a candle, ring the bell, send a draught; each mood its own sound and picture: Vigil still,
# Procession a pace with figures walking, Sealed no flame and a shaft of light, Embers low and red
# (the simulator boots into Sakura; Crypt is the second to last scene there, before Forest Ruins: PRESETS two back)
wait 800
spin PRESET -1
wait 150
spin PRESET -1
wait 1500
expect scene 3
expect knob0 0
expect knob1 25
expect knob8 3
expect knob12 50
expect candles 5
expect textfit 0
peakreset
wavgain 24
wav crypt.wav
wait 60000
wavstop
expect gutters >3
expect scnotes >3
expect tolls >0
expect crdrips >1
expect drones >0
expect nvoices <13
expect peak_db_max -27
expect peak_db_min -40
shot crypt.png
# black keys: the first five a candle each (snuffed, lit again)
tapkey b0
wait 3000
expect candles 4
tapkey b0
wait 3000
expect candles 5
# the next five the bell, a note each; the top one a draught
tapkey b7
wait 100
expect crnote 2
tapkey b10
wait 100
expect draughts 1
# white keys: sixteen notes rising from 3
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect crnote 3
expect lastkey 3
tapkey w15
wait 100
expect crnote 18
# Mood (KNOB 1): Vigil, in In (Phrygian's five): the bowl, monks, no pace, no water
spin K1 1
wait 500
expect knob0 1
expect scalenow 0
expect keyoff 0
expect knob2 2
expect knob9 0
expect paces 0
wait 8000
shot crypt-vigil.png
# Sealed: one candle, Hungarian minor a fourth down, a shaft of light; the drops are the notes
spin K1 2
wait 20000
expect knob0 3
expect scalenow 6
expect keyoff -500
expect candles 1
expect knob8 0
expect beam >90
expect crlight <60
expect walkers 0
shot crypt-sealed.png
# Embers: three candles, harmonic minor, home again
spin K1 1
wait 12000
expect scalenow 5
expect keyoff 0
expect candles 3
shot crypt-embers.png
# Procession: all five, Dorian, a step every 1.1 s, figures crossing, the bell every other bar
spin K1 -2
wait 30000
expect knob0 2
expect scalenow 4
expect candles 5
expect knob12 0
expect crlight >80
expect paces >24
expect paces <30
expect walkers >1
expect beam <5
shot crypt-procession.png
# back to Vigil: the pace stops, the figures walk on out
spin K1 -1
wait 500
expect paces <30
wait 16000
expect walkers 0
# pixel art, and a new vault (another arch, other stones)
tap GLO
wait 1500
expect style 1
shot crypt-pixel.png
tap GLO
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 2500
expect regrows 1
shot crypt-regrown.png
# back to the instrument: everything lets go, the instrument's own scale again
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 9000
expect mode 0
expect nvoices 0
expect par1 0
expect stale 0
